sequenceDiagram
    participant Sidecar as NBA sidecar
    participant Worker as Worker sync
    participant Current as nba_play_by_play_actions
    participant Revisions as nba_pbp_revisions
    participant Api as /v1/live/:gameId
    participant Ui as Live page

    Sidecar->>Worker: Scoreboard and play-by-play payloads
    Worker->>Current: Upsert latest action by game and action number
    Worker->>Revisions: Append changed action snapshot at generatedAt
    Api->>Revisions: Select latest revision where captured_at <= windowEnd
    Api->>Revisions: Filter visible actions where time_actual <= windowEnd
    Api->>Ui: activity.gameState, recentPlayByPlay, count

